/S /P
/ActualText ("Utilize the BANT framework \(Budget, Authority, Need, Timing\) to effectively qualify outbound sales leads in [industry]. Start by identifying the budget your [target audience] has allocated for [your product/service]. Determine who holds the decision-making authority in their organization and understand their specific needs and pain points that your product/service can address. Finally, assess the urgency of their timing to prioritize leads that are more likely to convert soon. This systematic approach helps streamline your sales efforts and focus on high-potential prospects. After you have given me this answer, ask me for my custom inputs, and then run the prompt based on that.")
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [0]
