<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText ("Leverage the MEDDIC framework \(Metrics, Economic Buyer, Decision Criteria, Decision Process, Identify Pain, Champion\) to navigate complex outbound sales scenarios in [industry]. Focus on understanding the key metrics that drive the prospect's decision-making. Identify the economic buyer who has the financial authority to approve the purchase. Define the decision criteria and ensure your product/service aligns with these requirements. Map out the decision process, including key stakeholders and timelines. Uncover the prospect's pain points and position your solution as the remedy. Cultivate a relationship with a champion within the organization who advocates for your solution. After you have given me this answer, ask me for my custom inputs, and then run the prompt based on that.")
