/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText ("Implement the Value Selling framework to highlight the return on investment \(ROI\) of your product/service in outbound sales conversations with [target audience]. Start by understanding the prospect's key business objectives and challenges. Quantify the potential financial impact of your solution using relevant metrics and data. Create a value proposition that clearly outlines the benefits and ROI of your product/service. Use case studies and testimonials to reinforce your points. This approach helps prospects see the tangible value of your solution and makes the decision-making process easier. After you have given me this answer, ask me for my custom inputs, and then run the prompt based on that.")
