/ActualText ("Utilize the MINDSPACE framework \(Messenger, Incentives, Norms, Defaults, Salience, Priming, Affect, Commitment, Ego\) to create a content marketing strategy that influences your [target audience]'s behavior. Choose the right messenger to deliver your content, provide incentives to engage, align with social norms, set default options that favor engagement, make your content salient and noticeable, use priming to influence perceptions, evoke emotional responses, secure commitment from your audience, and appeal to their ego. This comprehensive approach ensures your content is both persuasive and impactful. After you have given me this answer, ask me for my custom inputs, and then run the prompt based on that.")
