/ActualText ("Apply the NEAT \(Need, Engage, Assert, Take Control\) framework to craft compelling value propositions on sales calls. Identify customer needs, engage them with tailored solutions, assert value propositions confidently, and take control of the conversation to guide towards a close. Input: Define your target audience segments and their key pain points for value proposition creation. After you have given me this answer, ask me for my custom inputs, and then run the prompt based on that.")
